---
/**
 * One manuscript section, rendered as a card.
 *
 * Section identity comes from the Markdown heading inside the component, so
 * Astro's automatic heading anchors and the chapter jump navigation stay in
 * sync without a hand-maintained list of ids.
 *
 * Use in a chapter like:
 *
 * ```mdx
 * <Section>
 *
 * ## 1.1 Background of the Study
 *
 * Prose goes here.
 *
 * </Section>
 * ```
 */
---

<article class="chapter-article" data-reveal>
  <slot />
</article>
